@api = http://localhost:5080

### Listar candidatos
GET {{api}}/api/candidates

### Cadastrar candidato válido
POST {{api}}/api/candidates
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Mariana Exemplo Souza",
  "email": "mariana.souza@example.com",
  "phone": "(41) 98765-4321",
  "desiredPosition": "Desenvolvedora de Sistemas",
  "professionalSummary": "Experiência com .NET, React e SQL Server."
}

### Cadastro inválido (nome ausente, e-mail sem domínio) -> 400
POST {{api}}/api/candidates
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "   ",
  "email": "mariana@exemplo"
}

### Detalhes
GET {{api}}/api/candidates/1

### Candidato inexistente -> 404
GET {{api}}/api/candidates/999999

### Importar currículo em PDF (não salva; só devolve os dados encontrados)
POST {{api}}/api/resumes/parse
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=CurriculoBoundary

--CurriculoBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="curriculo-ficticio.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ../samples/curriculo-ficticio.pdf
--CurriculoBoundary--
